	"Description": "Kawaii Dynamic Motions: KawaiiPhysics 1.7.0 for UE 4.26 with the newest KawaiiPhysics' features fused in, its own motions (1.9: waves and a looping key animation that move a node's bones, the physics on top) and (1.10) KawaiiPhysics' sync bones (a coat's strips follow a knee). Its preview runs Create a Character System's own simulation (FINAL FANTASY VII REBIRTH, game mod 3.17.0); Export For Game writes an AnimBlueprint's nodes as the game mod's \"kawaii\" entries, and Import From Game makes them back into nodes. Editor only: keep AnimBlueprints with these nodes out of game paks.",
